Z||000000||RiceCooker||08-11-2000||05:45 PM||||Yep, it was a sad, sad day. <P>Last night we had our bi-weekly fiero meeting and all was going well. We had a few new guys showing up and we've got more than 15, in just a few months!<P>this guy pulls up in a maroon GT with more lights and neon than exhaust manifold cracks (supposed to be a joke, HAHAHA) and his seats are pushed way up forward like there's some serious subs or somethin. So we get checkin out the back of his car, meanwhile he walks by us without even saying hi (we meet at a drive thru restaurant) But on the back of his car, instead of saying "GT", it says, "Turbo GT". I did't get very excited since i had a bead feeling and sure enough when we asked him, nope it's not a turbo.<P>A moment of silence please<BR>I feel so unclean||||reg||13
Z||000001||deceler8||08-11-2000||06:16 PM||||He probably didn't know that he was driving a domestic car...<P>Next time you see this guy, clue him in...and you'll probably see shortly thereafter a pimped out "Turbo GT" on some used car lot.||||reg||1
